APEX AUTENTICA UI — LICENCE NOT YET SUPPLIED

composer.json declares this package "proprietary". The licence text itself has
deliberately not been written or adapted here.

Core's LICENSE-PRO was copied as a starting point and then removed, because its
terms are scoped to the Pro TIER — "everything under src/Pro/" — which does not
describe this package at all. Search-and-replacing a product name through a legal
document produces something that reads as though it were reviewed and was not.

Replace this file with LICENSE, drafted or adapted by whoever owns that decision.
